        "She knows what I am."

Which expands to:

        ro bu'a zo'u ge da jei zei jei gi ko'a djuno ku'au
        da jei mi bu'a
        "For every F(), there is something that is a truth value and
        that she thinks is the truth value of the proposition F(mi)."

